    "title": "Biblia del Oso original 1569",
    "description": "Free Bear Bible in Spanish with offline audio.\r\n\r\nGet this free digital version of the Holy Bible in Spanish and read or listen to the Bible through the audio system.\r\n\r\nIf you need strength to overcome challenges, comfort to overcome pain, or want to feel God's love for you, read the Bible. By better understanding the Scriptures, we will find the purpose of our lives. We help you. We offer you an intuitive and modern app so that you can always have the Word of God on your Android device, right at hand.\r\n\r\n\r\nKNOW ITS MULTIPLE FUNCTIONALITIES\r\n\r\n- It is free, intuitive and easy to navigate between books\r\n- It has sound. Regulate the volume and listen to each verse or the entire chapter\r\n- Works online and offline, even if you are not connected to the Internet\r\n- Create photos with images and verses to post on the networks\r\n- Configure the app to receive motivational verses every morning on your cell phone\r\n- The text of the Bible is very long. If you want to search for something in particular, use the keyword system\r\n\r\nCUSTOMIZE YOUR BIBLE\r\n\r\n- Highlight verses with colors, add notes and create your own favorites file\r\n- Change the font size if you need it\r\n- When you use the phone at night, do you feel tired and can't sleep easily? The cause may be the blue light on the screen of your device. Apply night mode to fix this issue\r\n\r\nSHARE THE WORD\r\n\r\n-Post photos and verses on Facebook and other social networks\r\n-Send biblical verses or paragraphs to your friends by e-mail, SMS, Messenger or WhatsApp.\r\n- Share the app with other believers\r\n\r\n\r\nCOLLECTION OF SACRED BOOKS\r\n\r\nThe Holy Bible or the Holy Bible is a collection of holy books. It is a compilation of Scythian works by different authors.\r\nThe Old Testament announces the coming of Jesus Christ and the details of the history of God's people. Contains 39 books: (Genesis, Exodus, Leviticus, Numbers, Deuteronomy, Joshua, Judges, Ruth, 1 Samuel, 2 Samuel, 1 Kings, 2 Kings, 1 Chronicles, 2 Chronicles, Ezra, Nehemiah, Esther, Job, Psalms, Proverbs , Ecclesiastes, Song of Solomon, Isaiah, Jeremiah, Lamentations, Ezekiel, Daniel, Hosea, Joel, Amos, Obadiah, Jonah, Micah, Nahum, Habakkuk, Zephaniah, Haggai, Zechariah, Malachi)\r\n\r\nThe New Testament recounts the birth, ministry, life, death, and resurrection of Jesus. It also describes how Jesus Christ organized his church on earth and prepared his servants to spread the gospel. Contains 27 books: (Matthew, Mark, Luke, John, Acts, Romans, 1 Corinthians, 2 Corinthians, Galatians, Ephesians, Philippians, Colossians, 1 Thessalonians, 2 Thessalonians, 1 Timothy, 2 Timothy, Titus, Philemon, Hebrews, James , 1 Peter, 2 Peter, 1 John, 2 John, 3 John, Jude, Revelation)",
    "descriptionHTML": "Free Bear Bible in Spanish with offline audio.<br><br>Get this free digital version of the Holy Bible in Spanish and read or listen to the Bible through the audio system.<br><br>If you need strength to overcome challenges, comfort to overcome pain, or want to feel God&#39;s love for you, read the Bible. By better understanding the Scriptures, we will find the purpose of our lives. We help you. We offer you an intuitive and modern app so that you can always have the Word of God on your Android device, right at hand.<br><br><br>KNOW ITS MULTIPLE FUNCTIONALITIES<br><br>- It is free, intuitive and easy to navigate between books<br>- It has sound. Regulate the volume and listen to each verse or the entire chapter<br>- Works online and offline, even if you are not connected to the Internet<br>- Create photos with images and verses to post on the networks<br>- Configure the app to receive motivational verses every morning on your cell phone<br>- The text of the Bible is very long. If you want to search for something in particular, use the keyword system<br><br>CUSTOMIZE YOUR BIBLE<br><br>- Highlight verses with colors, add notes and create your own favorites file<br>- Change the font size if you need it<br>- When you use the phone at night, do you feel tired and can&#39;t sleep easily? The cause may be the blue light on the screen of your device. Apply night mode to fix this issue<br><br>SHARE THE WORD<br><br>-Post photos and verses on Facebook and other social networks<br>-Send biblical verses or paragraphs to your friends by e-mail, SMS, Messenger or WhatsApp.<br>- Share the app with other believers<br><br><br>COLLECTION OF SACRED BOOKS<br><br>The Holy Bible or the Holy Bible is a collection of holy books. It is a compilation of Scythian works by different authors.<br>The Old Testament announces the coming of Jesus Christ and the details of the history of God&#39;s people. Contains 39 books: (Genesis, Exodus, Leviticus, Numbers, Deuteronomy, Joshua, Judges, Ruth, 1 Samuel, 2 Samuel, 1 Kings, 2 Kings, 1 Chronicles, 2 Chronicles, Ezra, Nehemiah, Esther, Job, Psalms, Proverbs , Ecclesiastes, Song of Solomon, Isaiah, Jeremiah, Lamentations, Ezekiel, Daniel, Hosea, Joel, Amos, Obadiah, Jonah, Micah, Nahum, Habakkuk, Zephaniah, Haggai, Zechariah, Malachi)<br><br>The New Testament recounts the birth, ministry, life, death, and resurrection of Jesus. It also describes how Jesus Christ organized his church on earth and prepared his servants to spread the gospel. Contains 27 books: (Matthew, Mark, Luke, John, Acts, Romans, 1 Corinthians, 2 Corinthians, Galatians, Ephesians, Philippians, Colossians, 1 Thessalonians, 2 Thessalonians, 1 Timothy, 2 Timothy, Titus, Philemon, Hebrews, James , 1 Peter, 2 Peter, 1 John, 2 John, 3 John, Jude, Revelation)",
